1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire
Knight of the Ribbon

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Knight of the Ribbon,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Tenth Episode
The Dangerous Doll
Sapphire Carnival

15
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:25,880
Look Franz, look at the pathetic state you're in.

16
00:02:26,570 --> 00:02:29,300
I'm sorry, I read too many mangas last night.

17
00:02:30,045 --> 00:02:32,580
We will soon enter the Kingdom of Silverland.

18
00:02:33,145 --> 00:02:34,633
Pull yourself together and act like a proper prince.

19
00:02:43,390 --> 00:02:45,380
What happened to Sapphire, Duralumin?

20
00:02:46,020 --> 00:02:48,560
It seems he went out for a walk somewhere again.

21
00:02:49,020 --> 00:02:50,140
What a troublesome one.

22
00:02:50,480 --> 00:02:53,360
Compared to him, Prince Franz is so splendid!

23
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:13,399
Welcome! We are honored by your arrival.

24
00:03:13,744 --> 00:03:14,744
Chanel V

25
00:03:14,945 --> 00:03:16,860
Well, it has been a long time.

26
00:03:17,070 --> 00:03:18,070
Look, Franz.

27
00:03:26,200 --> 00:03:27,839
Prince Franz has disappeared?

28
00:03:28,514 --> 00:03:31,220
That is truly a most disgraceful matter.

29
00:03:31,385 --> 00:03:34,140
To think they would disappear after our country invited them—

30
00:03:34,171 --> 00:03:36,320
King Chanel V is fuming as well.

31
00:03:36,345 --> 00:03:38,306
Well, I'll go look for them.

32
00:03:39,514 --> 00:03:40,920
That would be a problem.

33
00:03:41,106 --> 00:03:42,898
Only after you've met King Chanel V...

34
00:03:42,922 --> 00:03:44,326
Don't worry about it, don't worry about it.

35
00:03:44,700 --> 00:03:46,513
Just tell them I disappeared too.

36
00:03:47,590 --> 00:03:49,320
No, you can't! You can't!

37
00:03:49,454 --> 00:03:50,720
I said no!

38
00:03:54,420 --> 00:03:55,420
Come on, Opal!

39
00:04:13,620 --> 00:04:15,740
Sapphire, let me ride too!

40
00:05:22,630 --> 00:05:23,840
I wonder where they went?

41
00:05:23,864 --> 00:05:25,200
Where's Sapphire?

42
00:05:29,235 --> 00:05:30,920
What a strange building.

43
00:05:33,490 --> 00:05:34,560
I wonder what's inside?

44
00:05:39,310 --> 00:05:40,706
What could this be?

45
00:05:51,280 --> 00:05:54,340
Whoa, it's a giant doll.

46
00:06:00,480 --> 00:06:02,540
So this is the automaton doll?

47
00:06:02,880 --> 00:06:03,880
Yes, sir.

48
00:06:04,155 --> 00:06:06,599
Boy, it sure was a struggle to make.

49
00:06:06,900 --> 00:06:08,867
We brought in a puppeteer from a distant land,

50
00:06:08,891 --> 00:06:11,874
and kept it secret from the townspeople while installing a bow inside its mouth.

51
00:06:11,898 --> 00:06:13,420
Hey, cut the nonsense.

52
00:06:13,830 --> 00:06:16,533
Is it guaranteed to kill Sapphire?

53
00:06:17,530 --> 00:06:18,960
Spot on, absolutely.

54
00:06:19,300 --> 00:06:22,820
As long as Sapphire sits properly in the prince's seat to watch.

55
00:06:23,105 --> 00:06:24,105
Alright!

56
00:06:24,330 --> 00:06:25,905
You can't see it from the outside,

57
00:06:25,929 --> 00:06:28,300
but inside its belly, water is boiling piping hot.

58
00:06:28,645 --> 00:06:30,860
They say it moves using the power of that steam.

59
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:33,233
What do you think of it, Grand Duke Duralumin?

60
00:06:33,675 --> 00:06:35,260
Hmm.

61
00:06:35,775 --> 00:06:38,200
My, what a magnificent doll this is.

62
00:06:38,640 --> 00:06:39,840
Does it have a voice too?

63
00:06:42,795 --> 00:06:43,795
Nooo!

64
00:06:43,925 --> 00:06:45,700
Oho, it even has a voice!

65
00:06:46,200 --> 00:06:48,000
No, that shouldn't be possible.

66
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:49,680
It's him!

67
00:06:50,140 --> 00:06:51,640
Help me!

68
00:06:51,641 --> 00:06:53,000
You little brat!

69
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:56,040
Gotcha!

70
00:07:00,015 --> 00:07:01,120
I've got you now!

71
00:07:13,835 --> 00:07:15,640
You little brat!

72
00:07:20,469 --> 00:07:22,029
Where is he?

73
00:07:25,987 --> 00:07:27,154
Ouch!

74
00:07:30,060 --> 00:07:31,793
Damn you, now I'm mad!

75
00:07:35,336 --> 00:07:37,003
Help!

76
00:07:54,950 --> 00:07:57,573
Ah, what pretty fireworks.

77
00:08:00,678 --> 00:08:01,240
Ow, that hurts!

78
00:08:01,660 --> 00:08:02,660
Prince Sapphire!

79
00:08:03,060 --> 00:08:04,060
Prince Franz!

80
00:08:04,490 --> 00:08:06,020
Did you sneak out of the castle too?

81
00:08:06,960 --> 00:08:08,686
The town is really fun with the carnival going on.

82
00:08:08,805 --> 00:08:09,805
Let's go play!

83
00:08:11,180 --> 00:08:12,180
Y-Yeah.

84
00:08:18,900 --> 00:08:19,420
How is it?

85
00:08:19,465 --> 00:08:21,720
It's way more fun than staying inside the castle, isn't it, Sapphire?

86
00:08:24,440 --> 00:08:24,933
Yeah.

87
00:08:25,610 --> 00:08:27,588
Don't just stay shut up inside the castle—

88
00:08:27,612 --> 00:08:29,600
let's go outside and play to our heart's content!

89
00:08:30,035 --> 00:08:32,186
There's so much going on in town, it's really exciting.

90
00:08:32,462 --> 00:08:35,119
But I can't just play around all the time.

91
00:08:35,595 --> 00:08:37,127
Nylon and Duralumin are always up to no good,

92
00:08:37,151 --> 00:08:39,073
so I have to keep an eye on them.

93
00:08:39,585 --> 00:08:40,879
Cut that out.

94
00:08:41,155 --> 00:08:42,886
You've got to play as much as you can while you still can.

95
00:08:43,780 --> 00:08:45,420
Once you become king, you won't be able to do anything. Huh?

96
00:08:46,300 --> 00:08:47,719
Oh, that's right, I almost forgot.

97
00:08:48,675 --> 00:08:49,860
Here, this is for you.

98
00:08:50,220 --> 00:08:51,426
I bought it at a shop earlier.

99
00:08:51,900 --> 00:08:53,160
I think it's perfect for you.

100
00:08:53,525 --> 00:08:54,525
Open it and see.

101
00:08:57,185 --> 00:08:58,185
What's this?

102
00:08:58,605 --> 00:08:59,725
It's a mirror.

103
00:09:01,355 --> 00:09:03,960
You're a girl, after all—you should have at least one.

104
00:09:06,725 --> 00:09:08,000
Don't make fun of me, Prince Franz!

105
00:09:28,300 --> 00:09:29,580
Here comes another one.

106
00:09:29,695 --> 00:09:31,020
Throw this one in too.

107
00:09:31,185 --> 00:09:33,240
Let's dress them up in whatever clothes we have on hand.

108
00:09:33,265 --> 00:09:34,480
We're doing it right now!

109
00:09:36,260 --> 00:09:37,260
Hey, stop it!

110
00:09:38,840 --> 00:09:39,900
No way!

111
00:09:41,265 --> 00:09:42,265
What a surprise!

112
00:09:43,209 --> 00:09:44,880
Ah, this is wonderful.

113
00:09:45,105 --> 00:09:47,460
This is number one in the costume parade.

114
00:09:49,049 --> 00:09:50,049
It looks so embarrassing.

115
00:09:50,975 --> 00:09:52,540
Alright, let me set off!

116
00:10:22,809 --> 00:10:24,980
Wow, what a beautiful girl with flaxen hair

117
00:10:36,142 --> 00:10:37,433
Um, shall we dance?

118
00:12:22,529 --> 00:12:23,820
Everyone gather in front of the castle!

119
00:12:24,410 --> 00:12:25,613
It is the Great King's order!

120
00:13:01,279 --> 00:13:02,180
She's not here...

121
00:13:02,204 --> 00:13:03,433
I wonder where she could be?

122
00:13:06,839 --> 00:13:09,320
Excuse me! Have you seen a girl with flaxen hair?

123
00:13:09,889 --> 00:13:11,100
Nah, haven't seen her.

124
00:13:11,449 --> 00:13:12,449
You haven't?

125
00:13:12,965 --> 00:13:14,280
Well, I haven't seen her.

126
00:13:16,119 --> 00:13:17,119
Where did she go?

127
00:13:17,255 --> 00:13:18,820
She should be around here somewhere...

128
00:13:19,160 --> 00:13:21,560
How did you take care of that brat named Tink?

129
00:13:22,069 --> 00:13:24,140
We've locked him inside that factory.

130
00:13:24,345 --> 00:13:27,100
Tomorrow, when we defeat Sapphire, we'll finish him off together.

131
00:13:29,199 --> 00:13:31,300
What, defeat Sapphire?!

132
00:13:32,300 --> 00:13:32,960
This is terrible!

133
00:13:33,265 --> 00:13:34,833
I have to hurry and warn Sapphire!

134
00:13:35,989 --> 00:13:38,700
What happened to Franz and Prince Sapphire?

135
00:13:39,310 --> 00:13:42,680
Knowing those guys, they're probably making a racket somewhere.

136
00:13:44,805 --> 00:13:46,720
Play a more interesting song!

137
00:13:47,185 --> 00:13:48,980
Yes, yes, right away.

138
00:13:49,585 --> 00:13:51,560
So Sapphire was in a place like that.

139
00:13:52,005 --> 00:13:53,780
Up to those tricks again.

140
00:14:05,389 --> 00:14:07,395
No, no, something more lively would be better.

141
00:14:07,420 --> 00:14:08,420
Yes, yes.

142
00:14:14,544 --> 00:14:15,760
Hey, I'd prefer something more elegant.

143
00:14:16,200 --> 00:14:17,200
Yes.

144
00:14:18,340 --> 00:14:19,340
Sapphire.

145
00:14:20,620 --> 00:14:21,100
Who's there?

146
00:14:21,260 --> 00:14:22,260
Who called me?

147
00:14:22,739 --> 00:14:23,739
Over here, Sapphire.

148
00:14:25,900 --> 00:14:26,640
What's wrong?

149
00:14:26,740 --> 00:14:27,740
Franz.

150
00:14:28,300 --> 00:14:29,980
Nylon and his gang are up to no good.

151
00:14:30,360 --> 00:14:31,360
They say they're going to take you down.

152
00:14:33,930 --> 00:14:34,930
Is that all?

153
00:14:35,480 --> 00:14:36,640
There's nothing to be surprised about.

154
00:14:37,189 --> 00:14:38,189
It's the usual thing.

155
00:14:38,749 --> 00:14:40,740
But that kid named Tink is your friend, right?

156
00:14:41,195 --> 00:14:45,320
I'm not sure exactly where, but apparently he's locked up in a factory nearby.

157
00:14:45,980 --> 00:14:46,980
What?

158
00:15:10,340 --> 00:15:11,340
Is it here?

159
00:15:19,260 --> 00:15:20,260
Tink!

160
00:15:20,500 --> 00:15:21,340
Are you in here?

161
00:15:21,420 --> 00:15:22,420
Tink!

162
00:15:23,899 --> 00:15:26,120
There sure are a lot of dolls.

163
00:15:35,115 --> 00:15:35,800
Hey!

164
00:15:35,913 --> 00:15:37,353
Tink!

165
00:15:37,940 --> 00:15:39,140
Is he not here?

166
00:15:44,511 --> 00:15:46,038
Tink!

167
00:15:49,193 --> 00:15:50,379
Hey!

168
00:15:50,910 --> 00:15:52,739
Tink!

169
00:15:53,259 --> 00:15:54,765
Where are you?

170
00:15:57,893 --> 00:15:59,426
Tink!

171
00:16:02,169 --> 00:16:03,426
Is he not in this place?

172
00:16:03,660 --> 00:16:04,660
Let's look somewhere else.

173
00:16:25,461 --> 00:16:27,560
Are you sure about that doll?

174
00:16:27,585 --> 00:16:29,780
Will it really shoot Sapphire successfully?

175
00:16:30,560 --> 00:16:32,020
Nothing has been left to chance.

176
00:16:32,645 --> 00:16:33,645
Please take a look at that.

177
00:16:35,109 --> 00:16:38,637
When the doll's head catches on that wire, the mechanism inside will activate,

178
00:16:38,661 --> 00:16:41,640
shooting Sapphire straight through the chest.

179
00:16:42,355 --> 00:16:46,740
But Nylon, will Sapphire stay still until the doll passes by?

180
00:16:46,855 --> 00:16:49,280
Don't worry, I have successfully tricked the Doctor.

181
00:16:53,569 --> 00:16:55,860
Sapphire, did you find that kid named Tink?

182
00:16:56,539 --> 00:16:57,640
He wasn't found.

183
00:16:57,960 --> 00:16:59,520
We searched all night yesterday, though.

184
00:17:00,420 --> 00:17:00,946
Oh, right!

185
00:17:01,010 --> 00:17:02,010
I have to go look for him!

186
00:17:02,699 --> 00:17:08,200
Now, Your Highness, you promised to behave properly like a prince for the entire day today.

187
00:17:08,720 --> 00:17:09,720
I can handle it.

188
00:17:09,899 --> 00:17:11,180
I just shouldn't move from here, right?

189
00:17:34,999 --> 00:17:36,280
The doll is moving!

190
00:17:38,409 --> 00:17:40,826
By attaching a bow to the doll's mouth,

191
00:17:40,850 --> 00:17:44,300
I can definitely kill Sapphire.

192
00:17:46,286 --> 00:17:46,746
Huh?

193
00:17:47,061 --> 00:17:48,061
That's right!

194
00:18:06,780 --> 00:18:08,658
Sapphire, it's a trap!

195
00:18:09,049 --> 00:18:10,049
She isn't here!

196
00:18:50,099 --> 00:18:51,860
Sapphire, it's a trap!

197
00:19:18,906 --> 00:19:19,866
I did it!

198
00:19:30,415 --> 00:19:31,415
What is this?

199
00:19:33,660 --> 00:19:34,660
Sapphire!

200
00:19:34,906 --> 00:19:36,593
I'm okay.

201
00:19:37,319 --> 00:19:38,106
Look!

202
00:19:38,664 --> 00:19:40,866
That doll did it!

203
00:20:54,376 --> 00:20:55,169
Opal!

204
00:21:01,580 --> 00:21:02,784
Wait!

205
00:21:02,809 --> 00:21:03,900
You cursed dangerous doll!

206
00:21:18,735 --> 00:21:19,909
So you've come...

207
00:21:27,702 --> 00:21:28,920
Hi Sapphire!

208
00:21:28,921 --> 00:21:29,775
Tink!

209
00:21:29,800 --> 00:21:30,675
There you are!

210
00:21:30,700 --> 00:21:32,420
Thank goodness! You're alive!

211
00:21:32,445 --> 00:21:33,630
You bet I am!

212
00:21:33,979 --> 00:21:36,380
They said if you break the part where steam comes out, it'll stop!

213
00:21:37,500 --> 00:21:38,500
That must be it!

214
00:21:43,009 --> 00:21:44,920
It's gonna explode!

215
00:21:49,229 --> 00:21:51,573
Sapphire, It’s going to hit the castle!

216
00:22:09,412 --> 00:22:10,560
I'll help! Sapphire!

217
00:22:15,566 --> 00:22:16,560
Raise the bridge!

218
00:22:46,793 --> 00:22:48,300
This way! Follow me!

219
00:22:49,020 --> 00:22:49,560
Tink!

220
00:22:49,760 --> 00:22:50,280
Hurry up!

221
00:22:51,001 --> 00:22:52,019
I'm coming!

222
00:22:56,160 --> 00:22:57,295
Run fast!

223
00:22:57,320 --> 00:22:58,320
Alright!

224
00:23:07,260 --> 00:23:07,853
Thank you!

225
00:23:10,154 --> 00:23:13,500
About the mirror... I'm safe because you treated me like a girl.

226
00:23:14,164 --> 00:23:17,120
Rest assured, I won't say you're a girl anymore.

227
00:23:20,339 --> 00:23:23,180
You see, on the night of the festival, I met a wonderful girl.

228
00:23:24,324 --> 00:23:25,800
A girl with sky-blue hair.

229
00:23:27,259 --> 00:23:28,340
She was so pretty.

230
00:23:42,269 --> 00:23:43,269
Sapphire!

231
00:23:44,649 --> 00:23:46,280
The girl with the flaxen hair!

232
00:23:46,304 --> 00:23:48,039
I'll find her! I'll find that young lady!

233
00:24:27,301 --> 00:24:30,921
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

234
00:24:30,922 --> 00:24:34,282
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

235
00:24:34,283 --> 00:24:38,053
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

236
00:24:38,054 --> 00:24:41,215
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

237
00:24:41,216 --> 00:24:45,029
♪ Sen'nen man'nen hyakuman-nen ♪
A thousand years, ten thousand years, a million years,

238
00:24:45,030 --> 00:24:48,326
♪ Ribbon de tsunagou ichioku-nen ♪
Let’s connect with ribbons for a billion years!

239
00:24:48,327 --> 00:24:52,332
♪ Akuma ga kute mo arashi ga kute mo ♪
Even if demons come, even if storms arrive,

240
00:24:52,333 --> 00:24:55,771
♪ tsunaida kokoro wa hanarenai ♪
Our bonded hearts will never part.

241
00:24:55,772 --> 00:24:59,392
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

242
00:24:59,393 --> 00:25:02,753
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

243
